{"slug":"Universal-Script-Ultimate-ESP-V1-44782","_id":"68732ed2995b54f5a47c9f56","title":"Ultimate ESP V1","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"📜 Script Description: Ultimate ESP PRO v3 | Roblox\n\n🎮 Overview\n\nUltimate ESP v1 is an advanced ESP (Extra Sensory Perception) script for Roblox games. It displays player names, distance, health values, and a real-time highlight effect around players on the server (excluding yourself).\n\nThe script updates continuously, changing the highlight color when a player dies, and always keeping name tags visible — even on dead characters.\n\n⸻\n\n📦 Features\n\n✅ ESP NameTag\n\t•\tShows Player Name | Distance | ❤️ Health\n\t•\tBillboardGui attached to each player’s head\n\t•\tUses Cartoon font, small size, clean and readable\n\n✅ Highlight ESP\n\t•\tWhite outline with a red transparent fill (0.6 transparency) for clear visibility\n\t•\tChanges to a dark red when the player dies\n\n✅ Real-time Updates\n\t•\tConstantly updates NameTag text and highlight color in real time\n\t•\tAutomatically adds ESP when new players join the server\n\t•\tKeeps ESP visible even when a player dies\n\n✅ Exclude LocalPlayer\n\t•\tThe LocalPlayer is excluded from ESP display to prevent screen clutter\n\n⸻\n\n🛠️ How It Works\n\t•\tUses Players:GetPlayers() and Players.PlayerAdded to detect all players in the server\n\t•\tWhen a player’s character spawns (CharacterAdded), it creates a Highlight and BillboardGui\n\t•\tA while true loop with wait(0.3) updates player health, distance, and NameTag text constantly\n\t•\tChanges Highlight fill color when a player’s health drops to 0\n\t•\tPrevents ESP from being removed when players die\n\n⸻\n\n📌 Highlights\n\n✨ Transparent highlight color to avoid blocking character visibility\n✨ Small, clean NameTag size for clarity\n✨ Real-time display of health and distance\n✨ Automatic color change on death\n✨ Lightweight performance impact\n✨ Compatible with any Roblox game that allows LocalScripts\n\n⸻\n\n📣 Credits\n\nBY Boston and ChatGPT \nCustom-designed by Thai Roblox scripters (2025)","tags":["ESP","universal"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Yahahahau/Ultimate-Esp-v1/refs/heads/main/Ultimate%20esp%20v1.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"68499a2e0f380c18eedff8f7","username":"Yahahaha","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/b905399fdbb176720e2908288a2e69338d8cb680896dde45f809a79ed052683d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68499a2e0f380c18eedff8f7-1752378217808.jpeg"},"status":"offline","id":"68499a2e0f380c18eedff8f7","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/b905399fdbb176720e2908288a2e69338d8cb680896dde45f809a79ed052683d.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/68499a2e0f380c18eedff8f7-1752378217808.jpeg"}},"verified":false,"views":102691,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/aa767b33a54a2a4e040bacf2c703a9221dc9d39b0a565f09aec581b9497a72b8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1752379090294.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1752379090294.jpg"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-07-13T03:58:10.381Z","executes":13083,"keyless":false,"milestones":[{"key":"script.executions","tier":10000,"value":10053,"at":"2026-10-06T18:30:06.178Z"}],"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-16T02:54:17.606Z","last":"","win":14,"math":2},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/aa767b33a54a2a4e040bacf2c703a